.TH COMPUTER-MCP 1 "September 2026" "computer-mcp 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
computer-mcp \- host-side MCP stdio proxy for a Linux VM guest
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B node dist/index.js --remote-target user@guest
.SH DESCRIPTION
Runs the host-side MCP stdio proxy. It forwards MCP traffic over OpenSSH to the Computer-MCP-Backend runtime inside a Linux VM. GUI, X11, shell, filesystem, Selenium, browser state, and tool execution remain in the guest. This repository contains no guest implementation.
.SH INSTALLATION
.EX
npm ci
npm run build
npm test
.EE
The guest runtime is maintained in the Computer-MCP-Backend repository. Build it inside the VM and keep its X11 session active.
.SH REMOTE OPTIONS
.IP "--remote-target TARGET" 4
SSH target such as user@192.168.122.50. Required for remote mode.
.IP "--remote-port PORT" 4
Optional SSH port.
.IP "--remote-identity FILE" 4
Optional private key file.
.IP "--remote-known-hosts FILE" 4
Optional dedicated known-hosts file.
.IP "--remote-command COMMAND" 4
Command executed in the guest. Defaults to node /opt/computer-mcp-backend/dist/index.js.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
COMPUTER_MCP_SSH_TARGET, COMPUTER_MCP_SSH_PORT, COMPUTER_MCP_SSH_IDENTITY, COMPUTER_MCP_SSH_KNOWN_HOSTS, COMPUTER_MCP_SSH_BIN, and COMPUTER_MCP_REMOTE_COMMAND configure the same proxy. CLI options take precedence over environment configuration.
.SH EXAMPLES
.B mcpo --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8084 -- node C:\\path\\to\\Computer-MCP\\dist\\index.js --remote-target user@192.168.122.50 --remote-command "node /opt/computer-mcp-backend/dist/index.js"
.PP
.B node dist/index.js --remote-target user@192.168.122.50 --remote-command 'node /opt/computer-mcp-backend/dist/index.js'
.SH TROUBLESHOOTING
If MCPO reports "McpError: Connection closed", verify the host build, OpenSSH client, key, known-hosts file, guest path, guest Node.js, and Backend build. Test the guest command directly with SSH. The host proxy does not provide WSL fallback or Windows GUI execution.
.SH SECURITY
The host process only proxies stdio over SSH. Use host-key verification and a dedicated guest account. Do not disable host-key checks or copy guest browser credentials to the host.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on clean shutdown; non-zero when SSH or the guest process fails.
.SH FILES
.I dist/index.js
